{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":198400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8625.441952,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9043.161671,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9098.108485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9100.348134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9101.71158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9102.529745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9104.30989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9105.973089,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":13918.575335,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben,"},{"kind":"text","t":14140.346763,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie The Templar Legacy,"},{"kind":"audio","t":14182.96651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14184.250507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14184.518251,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":20366.930035,"text":"Denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":20672.197998,"text":"You might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":20719.564446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20721.238842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20722.911215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20724.657379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":20724.993035,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":32518.688309999998,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":32826.757999,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for various reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":32876.956469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32878.34924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32879.936685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":32881.685443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32883.471747999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32884.244434,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":42410.349031,"text":"Das Cochamotal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Yosemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":42926.558744,"text":"Cochamó Tal is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":42982.325815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":42984.180874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42986.34601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42988.548633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42990.715562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42992.852196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":42995.073416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42997.270481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42998.966239,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":48134.928411,"text":"Aristoteles Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":48411.429325,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":48457.376212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48458.798628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48460.578062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48462.275102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48463.532159,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":57706.321973,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":57982.534101,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":58025.757008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58027.64076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":58029.410179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":58029.587517,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":58073.495327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58074.851913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58076.576755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":58076.789196,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":70119.886941,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":70565.18675800001,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":70614.10689000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70615.690929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":70617.397123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70619.168676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70620.952437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70622.660864,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":72312.268276,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72515.739426,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":72561.809127,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72563.23752200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72564.705537,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":81098.67884800001,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht."},{"kind":"text","t":81301.145642,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital."},{"kind":"audio","t":81347.303337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":81349.349153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81350.79361200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":81351.00087500001,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":85082.07648100001,"text":"Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":85206.496262,"text":"He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":85247.129763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85248.15508000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":85248.305707,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":90132.81276,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse."},{"kind":"text","t":90405.197574,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":90452.38063500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90453.86804900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90455.56682200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90457.33244500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":90457.482472,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":95227.310788,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":95456.82253300001,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":95503.297476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":95505.191313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95506.740531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95508.01558400001,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":100336.747453,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":100595.640604,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":100642.353826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100643.80348300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100647.040447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100647.495884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":100647.64226400001,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107851.22541500001,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":108221.23381100001,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":108275.163696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108276.63580100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108278.31374700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":108280.14963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108281.943459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":108282.149099,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118570.416385,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":118967.278365,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":119021.66298400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":119023.117173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119024.79410700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119026.50790600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119028.249217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":119030.091459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119032.000593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":119032.13776900001,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129029.22783100001,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":129587.531873,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing Super G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":129643.668809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129645.57350600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129647.016157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129648.703767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129650.529835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129652.378918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129654.174811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129655.14946800002,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":139519.263489,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich"},{"kind":"text","t":139949.538096,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion spread the disease unintentionally"},{"kind":"audio","t":140006.268897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140007.764608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140009.42473600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140011.173258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":140013.001189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":140014.846526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140016.604662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140018.394506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140019.55090600002,"samples":26456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":142080.48575000002,"text":"nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142192.90691400002,"text":"introduced to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":142232.435736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142232.789598,"samples":18832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":148140.919832,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":148415.80724,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":148462.500043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148464.083967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":148465.760841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148467.66926300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148468.917181,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":155370.801863,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":155689.950334,"text":"He also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex was no match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":155733.304623,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":155734.717299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155735.43096300002,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"audio","t":155769.726608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155771.364013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155773.093696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155773.76522600002,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":167517.634545,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":167916.51407200002,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":167970.857239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167972.38452700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167974.14888300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167975.952748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167977.666677,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167979.504793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167981.307817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167981.855401,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":175056.36117000002,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"text","t":175362.12182200002,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"audio","t":175410.267622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175411.867239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175413.44927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175415.117932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175415.78650800002,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":176672.723318,"text":"Ja, Dugan."},{"kind":"text","t":176801.808723,"text":"Yes, Dugan."},{"kind":"audio","t":176841.193467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":176841.41348800002,"samples":9832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":185578.514957,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste. Das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":185996.919349,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast. Swimming is safe here."},{"kind":"audio","t":186046.023781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186047.615216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186049.34727300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186051.15469300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186052.097863,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":186078.09893500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186078.634981,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":196959.993034,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder"},{"kind":"text","t":197291.610741,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":197331.963923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":197333.47071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197335.19266200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197336.99646700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197338.848304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197340.814503,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":198561.727427,"text":"Bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":198644.374732,"text":"Famous."},{"kind":"audio","t":198683.75543000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":198684.03486,"samples":3232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":208702.38326600002,"code":1005}]}